{"bendscript":"0.1","blocks":[{"id":"blk-36295","kind":"heading","level":1,"spans":[{"id":"spn-55558","text":"Forge Semantic IR v1 — MEASURE (pre-freeze memo)"}]},{"id":"blk-36296","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-55559","text":"*Status: "},{"id":"spn-55560","marks":["bold"],"text":"MEASURE only — NOT frozen."},{"id":"spn-55561","text":" This is the \"measure before building\" artifact for WRL Phase 2 (freeze Forge Semantic IR v1). It inventories the IR vocabulary the forge lowering has ALREADY grounded, maps the frozen WRL Core 0.1 families onto it, and isolates the open freeze-decisions that need a GPT-5.6 ruling before anything is frozen.*"}]},{"id":"blk-36297","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-55562","text":"Per the WRL architectural rule: WRL Core → "},{"id":"spn-55563","marks":["bold"],"text":"Forge Semantic IR"},{"id":"spn-55564","text":" → TRVM facts/films/reductions. WRL surface text never lowers directly to interaction-calculus text. IR v1 is that middle layer. This memo measures what it must contain."}]},{"id":"blk-36298","kind":"heading","level":2,"spans":[{"id":"spn-55565","text":"1. What is already grounded (the de-facto IR)"}]},{"id":"blk-36299","kind":"paragraph","spans":[{"id":"spn-55566","text":"The forge lowering ("},{"id":"spn-55567","marks":["code"],"text":"fixture.py"},{"id":"spn-55568","text":" → "},{"id":"spn-55569","marks":["code"],"text":"compiler.py"},{"id":"spn-55570","text":"/"},{"id":"spn-55571","marks":["code"],"text":"lower_e2a.py"},{"id":"spn-55572","text":"/"},{"id":"spn-55573","marks":["code"],"text":"admit_ic.py"},{"id":"spn-55574","text":" → IC) already consumes a structured graph description and a per-epoch input. That structure IS a proto-IR. Measured surface:"}]},{"id":"blk-36300","kind":"heading","level":3,"spans":[{"id":"spn-55575","text":"1.1 Node kinds (5, closed today)"}]},{"head":[{"id":"blk-36302","spans":[{"id":"spn-55576","text":"Kind"}]},{"id":"blk-36303","spans":[{"id":"spn-55577","text":"Params"}]},{"id"